.git
tests
.env
*.db
# NOTE: `xtask` must NOT be ignored here. It is a workspace member, and
# `cargo chef prepare` runs `cargo metadata`, which has to load every
# member's manifest — excluding the directory fails the build outright. It is
# kept out of the *image* instead: the Dockerfile names its binaries
# explicitly (`--bin halation --bin backfill_media_keys`) and copies only
# those, so xtask is never compiled or shipped.
docker-compose.yml
CHANGELOG.md
README.md
